   "description": "The black dial has a glossy finish. It gives the watch a warm, classy and luxurious feel. Applied Breguet numerals. Curved leaf shaped hands with a bent tip. The Angelier Classique is an elegant watch. Inspired by the 1930s to 1950s. In a modern 3-piece stainless steel case. Thanks to the profile design, the watch hugs the wrist and wears very comfortably. With a thickness of only 8.5 mm including box-shaped sapphire crystal, it is a flat and ultra-thin design that was only possible due to the caliber used. With a water resistance of 50 m, the watch is good for daily use. And it is a pleasure to have a view of the beautiful hand-winding caliber when you turn the watch.",
